17-14-0300.
(Prior code § 20-1; Amend Coun. J. 12-11-91, p. 10832; Amend Coun. J. 11-19-08,
p. 47220, Art. VIII, § 1; Amend Coun. J. 11-17-10, p. 106597, Art. IX, § 2;
Amend Coun. J. 11-26-13, p. 67481, Art. I, § 5; Amend Coun. J. 5-25-18, p.
78316, § 1)
