as this §
4-228-030, and repealed former § 4-228-030, which pertained to the commissioner
and powers and duties thereof.
4-228-031 Reserved.
Editor's note– Coun. J. 5-9-12, p. 27485, § 106, repealed former § 4-228-031,
which pertained to remedial measures.
4-228-040 License fee.
   The license fee for a motor vehicle repair shop shall be as set forth in
Section
4-5-010 of this Code.
(Added Coun. J. 12-9-92, p. 25465; Amend Coun. J. 10-7-93, p. 39429; Amend
