7-40-300 Compliance with city rules.
   No mix or frozen dessert shall be sold for consumption within the City of
Chicago, unless it has been produced, processed, transported and handled in
compliance with the requirements of the rules of the Department of Health.
(Added Coun. J. 6-10-96, p. 23652; Amend Coun. J. 12-13-17, p. 63286, § 4)
