7-40-350 Pasteurization of milk and milk products.
   No milk or milk products shall be sold in the City of Chicago except grade A
pasteurized milk and milk products. Grade A pasteurized milk and milk products
shall conform with the rules of the Department of Health for Grade A
pasteurized milk and milk products.
(Added Coun. J. 6-10-96, p. 23652; Amend Coun. J. 12-13-17, p. 63286, § 4)
