      (10)   All locations adjacent to either side of West Lawrence Avenue,
between North Kilbourn Avenue and North Lowell Avenue.
         All locations adjacent to either side of North Elston Avenue, between
West Kilbourn Avenue and West Kostner Avenue.
         All locations adjacent to either side of West Irving Park Road,
between North Lavergne Avenue and North Clover Street.
         All locations adjacent to either side of North Milwaukee Avenue,
between West Hutchinson Street and West Berenice Avenue, and between West Devon
and West Wilson Avenue.
         All locations adjacent to either side of North Cicero Avenue, between
