11-4-440 Sanitary landfill inspection.
   Inspection at all sanitary landfill operations shall be under the
jurisdiction of the commissioner of health. Inspections as necessary shall be
supervised by a state certified inspector who is qualified by training,
education and experience.
(Prior code § 17-1.41; Amend Coun. J. 12-11-91, p. 10978; Amend Coun. J. 11-16-
11, p. 13798, Art. II, § 6)
11-4-450 Reserved.
