amount heretofore specified as minimum charge for service. This charge shall
include service for all ordinary domestic fixtures and openings, but shall not
include service for outbuildings, air conditioning, or use of hose for
sprinkling, washing or like purposes, or other devices which require large
quantities of water. Such service as is not included shall be charged for
additionally at rates hereinafter specified.
